{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bd6f5861-c04c-8b26-a8e6-16982b21d186",
  "created_at": "2026-02-02T13:05:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Judith Tillinghast",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:03:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:03:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Good afternoon. My name is Judith Tillinghast. I have a question about the trash. I have a couch I want to put out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:03:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a couch. Bulk item. Where are you located, Ms. Tillinghast?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:03:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am at 472 Annandale Road. In the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:03:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 472 Annandale. So for a couch, you usually can't just set it out with the regular trash. Bulk items normally need to be scheduled for a pickup first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:03:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Scheduled. Please, can you say again? I want to be sure I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:03:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Don't just put the couch at the curb. You call and set up a bulk pickup, and they tell you which day to put it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:04:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I call, and they give me the day. Then I put it out. Is this right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:04:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. I can take down your information and get it started."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:04:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thank you. One moment please. [pause] I am sorry. I am hanging a picture on the wall. I am checking if it is level. Okay, it is good now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:04:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. Is it a regular couch, one piece?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:04:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. One couch. It is old. Not broken, only old."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:04:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I don't have the pickup calendar in front of me for your street, so I'd like a supervisor to confirm the day and any rules. Would you like a call back from a supervisor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:04:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. I want a supervisor to call me back. That is better."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:04:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:04:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0170."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:04:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 401-555-0170. Correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:04:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. When will they call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:05:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Probably today or tomorrow. It's Monday afternoon, so they should get to it soon. If you're not home, they'll leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:05:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Today or tomorrow. I will wait for the call. I will not put the couch outside until then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:05:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, that's the best plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:05:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T13:05:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Ms. Tillinghast. Bye now."
    }
  ],
